            <span id="alg1.l8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">else</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
              
              
              Initialize candidate list: <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{Candidates}\leftarrow\{b^{0}_{aug},b^{0}_{depth}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Candidates</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Candidates}\leftarrow\{b^{0}_{aug},b^{0}_{depth}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
              
              
              <span id="alg1.l10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(b^{1},c^{1})\in\{(b^{1}_{aug},c^{1}_{aug}),(b^{1}_{depth},c^{1}_{depth})\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(b^{1},c^{1})\in\{(b^{1}_{aug},c^{1}_{aug}),(b^{1}_{depth},c^{1}_{depth})\}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l10.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
              
              
               <span id="alg1.l11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c^{1}\geq T_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c^{1}\geq T_{2}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l11.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
              
              
                 Add <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b^{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b^{1}</annotation></semantics></math> to Candidates

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">13:</span></span>
              
              
               <span id="alg1.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l13.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l14.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">14:</span></span>
              
              
              <span id="alg1.l14.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l14.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l15.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">15:</span></span>
              
              
              Compute distance of each candidate to <math id="alg1.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{L}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l16.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">16:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b^{*}\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b^{*}\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> candidate with shortest distance to <math id="alg1.l16.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{L}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l17.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">17:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l17.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l17.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l18.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">18:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l18.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg1.l18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>b</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b^{*}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
<figure id="S2.F2" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.08278v1/examples2.png" id="S2.F2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:376/125;" width="376" height="125" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 2: </span>Visual comparisons on YouRefIt dataset (first two rows) and ISL pointing dataset (last two rows).</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="S3" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">3 </span>Experimental Results</h2>

<div id="S3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Datasets.</span>
For training, we utilize the YouRefIt <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">1</a>]</cite>, the widely used benchmark.
We evaluate our models on the YouRefIt test set and the unseen ISL pointing dataset <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">18</a>]</cite>.</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Evaluation.</span>
For evaluation metrics and setup, we follow prior work <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">1</a>]</cite>.
IoU is computed at three threshold values: <math id="S3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.25" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.25</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.25</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S3.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.50" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.50</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.50</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="S3.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.75" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.75</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.75</annotation></semantics></math>.
Additionally, objects are categorized as <span id="S3.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">small (S)</span>, <span id="S3.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">medium (M)</span>, and <span id="S3.p2.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">large (L)</span> based on their bounding box size, and scores are reported with respect to object size.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S3.T1" class="ltx_table">
<table id="S3.T1.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S3.T1.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S3.T1.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt"><span id="S3.T1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">IoU Threshold for mAP</span></th>
